/P 142 0 R
/E (The reason why most fashion brands fail is not their lack of good products; it is their weak brand identity. They lack aesthetic consistency, an emotional value, and a voice. Fashion brands should not be interchangeable because interchangeable means invisible. We start this document with that statement because you cannot build your system right until you know your problem.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
